### Test Coupon Availability API
### Test case 1: Check availability of one-time use coupon (not reserved/used)
GET {{host}}/coupon/{{coupon_id}}/availability?customer_id={{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Test case 2: Reserve one-time use coupon
POST {{host}}/coupon/{{coupon_id}}/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer_id}}",
  "transaction_id": "TXN-001"
}

### Test case 3: Check availability of one-time use coupon after reservation (should be false)
GET {{host}}/coupon/{{coupon_id}}/availability?customer_id={{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Test case 4: Check availability of multi-use coupon (should show remaining usage reduced by active reservations)
GET {{host}}/coupon/{{multi_use_coupon_id}}/availability?customer_id={{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Test case 5: Reserve multi-use coupon
POST {{host}}/coupon/{{multi_use_coupon_id}}/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer_id}}",
  "transaction_id": "TXN-002"
}

### Test case 6: Check availability of multi-use coupon after reservation
GET {{host}}/coupon/{{multi_use_coupon_id}}/availability?customer_id={{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Test case 7: Cancel reservation and check availability again
DELETE {{host}}/coupon/{{coupon_id}}/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer_id}}",
  "reservation_id": "{{reservation_id}}"
}

### Test case 8: Check availability after canceling reservation (should be available again)
GET {{host}}/coupon/{{coupon_id}}/availability?customer_id={{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Variables for testing:
# {{host}} = your API host
# {{access_token}} = your authentication token
# {{coupon_id}} = ID of one-time use coupon
# {{multi_use_coupon_id}} = ID of multi-use coupon
# {{customer_id}} = customer ID for testing
# {{reservation_id}} = reservation ID returned from reserve API
